{% section "BITE Model Assessment" %}
<!-- Steven Hassan's BITE Model: Behavior, Information, Thought, Emotional Control -->

### Behavior Control
- [ ] Regulate diet, sleep, grooming
- [ ] Financial exploitation (tithes, fees, donations)
- [ ] Restrict leisure activities
- [ ] Require permission for major decisions
- [ ] Punish dissent or deviation

### Information Control
- [ ] Deception / withholding information
- [ ] Restrict access to outside media
- [ ] Compartmentalize information
- [ ] Use propaganda extensively
- [ ] Discourage critical thinking

### Thought Control
- [ ] Loaded language / thought-terminating clichés
- [ ] Black-and-white / us-vs-them thinking
- [ ] Reject rational analysis
- [ ] Label alternative beliefs as evil/wrong
- [ ] Memory manipulation

### Emotional Control
- [ ] Instill irrational fears about leaving
- [ ] Shunning / disconnection from critics
- [ ] Guilt/shame manipulation
- [ ] Love bombing during recruitment
- [ ] Phobia indoctrination
{% endsection %}

